@startuml
title TRT System - UML Deployment Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Operator" as Operator

node "Developer workstation" as Workstation {
  artifact "Project checkout" as Checkout
  artifact ".env\nISAAC_HOST_RUNNER_URL\nM12_AUTOMATED_COMPARISON_TEST" as DotEnv
  artifact "data/isaac_host_config.json" as HostConfig

  node "Docker Desktop" as Docker {
    node "Container: trt-api" as TrtContainer {
      artifact "Python 3.11 image\nDockerfile.api" as ApiImage
      component "Uvicorn\ntrt_core.api:app\nport 8000" as Uvicorn
      component "Sequential candidate worker\nprocess-wide Isaac lock" as StrategyWorker
      artifact "/app/trt_core" as AppCode
      artifact "/app/scenario_generation" as ScenarioCode
      artifact "/app/schemas" as Schemas
      database "/app/data\nTRT, sessions, state,\nstrategy batches, audits" as AppData
      database "/app/outputs\nScenarioSpecs, RunArtifacts,\nM12 reports" as AppOutputs
    }

    node "Container: n8n" as N8nContainer {
      component "n8n chat and workflows\nport 5678" as N8n
      artifact "/home/node/.n8n/imports\nworkflow JSON" as WorkflowImports
    }
  }

  node "Windows host process" as WindowsHost {
    component "Host runner service\nhost_isaac_runner_service.py\nport 8765" as HostRunner
    component "Isaac Sim Python\npython.bat" as IsaacPython
    artifact "UR5 entry script\npick_up_example.py" as PickUp
    database "seed_sweep.sqlite3\nverified layout input" as SeedDB
  }

  database "Bind mount: ./data" as HostData
  database "Bind mount: ../dt_exchange\noutputs" as HostOutputs
}

cloud "Model host" as ModelHost {
  component "Configured production vLLM\nOpenAI-compatible\n/v1/chat/completions" as VLLM
  component "Benchmark model endpoints\nGemma / Qwen / Llama" as BenchmarkModels
}

Operator --> N8n : browser chat / webhook
Operator --> Uvicorn : optional direct API diagnostics
N8n --> Uvicorn : http://trt-api:8000
N8n --> VLLM : intent extraction and\noperator-response formatting
Uvicorn --> VLLM : dialogue processing and\nexploratory candidate generation
Uvicorn ..> BenchmarkModels : TC7 benchmark only

Uvicorn --> StrategyWorker : queue strategy batch
StrategyWorker --> HostRunner : one candidate at a time\nhttp://host.docker.internal:8765
HostRunner --> IsaacPython : start subprocess
IsaacPython --> PickUp : execute script
PickUp --> SeedDB : read verified layouts
PickUp --> HostOutputs : write run result SQLite
HostRunner --> StrategyWorker : status, result, and\nstartup timing evidence

Uvicorn --> AppData : read/write TRT, state,\nsessions, strategy selection
Uvicorn --> AppOutputs : ScenarioSpecs, RunArtifacts,\nevidence, metrics, reports

Checkout --> AppCode : bind mount
Checkout --> ScenarioCode : bind mount
Checkout --> Schemas : bind mount
HostData --> AppData : bind mount
HostOutputs --> AppOutputs : bind mount
DotEnv --> Uvicorn : compose environment
HostConfig --> Uvicorn : host path mapping
WorkflowImports --> N8n : imported/published workflows

note right of TrtContainer
  docker-compose.yml publishes:
  - trt-api: localhost:8000
  - n8n: localhost:5678

  Strategy batches are asynchronous at the API boundary,
  but candidate Isaac executions are strictly sequential.
end note

note right of WindowsHost
  Docker does not execute Windows Isaac paths.
  trt-api submits a host request; the host runner
  expands it into the Isaac command and preserves logs.
end note

note right of AppData
  A successful evidence-approved simulated deployment
  updates current state, digital-twin defaults,
  Time-Arrival state, and a deployment audit record.
  M12 automated comparison mode blocks deployment.
end note

@enduml
